            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[**Quick Chat.** Press ⌃⌥N in any app, or click Séance's crystal ball in the menu bar, to start a chat without leaving what you're doing. Return starts it; ⌘Return also opens it in Séance. Type `#` and a project's name to choose the project, then Tab.

New Chat (⌘⇧N) now looks like the phone's. Turn the shortcut or the menu bar icon off in Settings → General.
]]></description>
